1a:["$","p",null,{"children":["Pages move under you. ",["$","code",null,{"children":"execute"}]," failures that smell\nlike rot mark the tool ",["$","code",null,{"children":"staleSuspect"}]," (visible in\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"list"}],"): the page refused at runtime, or the tool\nvanished from the live tool list. Recovery is\nre-register: refresh discovery, author again, the new\nfiles overwrite the old."]}]
